        {
          "href": "https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/360015537111-How-to-remove-spam-traps-from-your-account#h_01J96S7E0TZW0DM80GZP9QCR8B",
          "text": "You will learn"
        },
        {
          "href": "https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/360015537111-How-to-remove-spam-traps-from-your-account#h_01J96S7E0T2NCKS5ESMQXC3DD5",
          "text": "Why you should remove spam traps"
